  <item>
    <title>大厂内卷vs裸辞躺平——何为良好生活？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/643999dea79cc814708a50d0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">643999dea79cc814708a50d0</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Apr 2023 18:22:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>播客我们 UniXer 新一期回归。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这一期，我们邀请到了 UniXer 数字游民社区的老朋友 —— 创始人之一，橙橙。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你可能知道她之前的经历，前大厂AI to B 产品经理，用 3 年时间从 0-1 打造亿级产品；你可能在商业化共学共创公会和商业化 Workshop 中见证过她理性、客观的观察和分析。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>在本期播客中，我们邀请你认识一个「不一样」的橙橙。</span></strong><span>抛却理性、信仰一跃的酒神精神，邀请你来到每个人生命的海洋底层，一起展开一次探险。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在年龄、职业、命运、选择背后，我们都在回答着一个共同的问题 —— </span><strong><span>「何为良好生活」</span></strong><span>？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎各位数字游民，在播客评论区，写下你自己的答案。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn3dBWldpePv5dJedXnSWE5uolvJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>——</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【你将听到】：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">00:01:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>橙橙是谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">00:02:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>分享 3 件你做过的最疯狂的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">00:07:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>抛却理性，信仰一跃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">00:10:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>把你的人生当作一个故事或一本小说，请告诉我们它有哪些章节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">00:11:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>尼采：骆驼、狮子和婴儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">00:16:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>30岁，我找到了自己人生的线头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">00:22:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>国内和国外的数字游民有什么区别？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">00:28:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>数字游民，都有哪些待被满足的「需求」？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">00:33:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>UniX数字游民社区创造了哪些产品来解决问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">00:54:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>你判断自己想做的事的标准是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3420">00:57:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>从辞职到现在，你有哪些新体悟？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3780">01:03:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>何为良好生活？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmc4yS0s-9cxomvy7nk82U-M-GC5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>——</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期音乐】：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>李志 - 热河</span></p><span></span><p><span>Patti Smith - Amerigo</span></p><span></span><p><span>——</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlypcER_JYfz4VUeIb0sgFeBfkGs.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期阅读资料】：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>书籍推荐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>陈嘉映 -《何为良好生活》</span></p><span></span><p><span>蒂娜·齐莉格 -《斯坦福创意课》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>橙橙创作的文章：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5MDIwNzAyMQ==&amp;mid=2247485188&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=dd1cf9f4d0b6aaa3d78cffd2fca939b2&amp;chksm=900e6146a779e850884ba743f265cf00c85e079606a0196c1f63d7b2a1d4403daa6dc968b1f0&amp;token=1156224361&amp;lang=zh_CN#rd" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5MDIwNzAyMQ==&amp;mid=2247485188&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=dd1cf9f4d0b6aaa3d78cffd2fca939b2&amp;chksm=900e6146a779e850884ba743f265cf00c85e079606a0196c1f63d7b2a1d4403daa6dc968b1f0&amp;token=1156224361&amp;lang=zh_CN#rd"><span>30岁大厂AI产品裸辞 ，成为数字游民—— 我的选择逻辑</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvafeN6PY_MEvoeAscHDftEqaJrU.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>——</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【UniX数字游民社区】：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>UniX是一个数字游民生活方式探索和共创型社区。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们将通过社区成员共创的方式，帮助每一个「认同并向往数字游民生活方式」的伙伴进行以下维度的探索：</span></p><span></span><p><span>💡事业方向的更多可能性</span></p><span></span><p><span>💡个人成长的更多可能性</span></p><span></span><p><span>💡生活模式的更多可能性</span></p><span></span><p><span>在UniX，我们与全球数字游民一起探索和共创自立、自在和自洽的生活方式。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【Follow us here】：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：UniX数字游民</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：UniX数字游民社区</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙播客：UniX数字游民社区</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们接上线了，stay tuned！</span></p>]]></description>
